@startuml Remove_Student_From_Group
title Activity Diagram - Remove Student from Group

|Instructor|
start
:Select a group;
:Select a student member;
:Click "Remove Member";
:Confirm removal;

|Web Application|
:Send request to remove member\nfrom group;

|Backend API|
:Validate parameters;
:Call GroupManagementService.\nRemoveMemberAsync(groupId, userId);
:Check if group exists;
if (Group not found?) then (yes)
  :Return 404 Not Found;
  stop
endif

:Check if member exists in group;
if (Member not found?) then (yes)
  :Return 404 Not Found;
  stop
endif

:Remove GroupMember entity;
:Save changes to database;
:Send notification to removed student;
:Return GroupMemberOperationResponseDto;
:Send 200 OK response;

|Web Application|
if (Response successful?) then (yes)
  :Display success message;
  :Refresh group members list;
else (no)
  :Display error message;
  stop
endif

|Instructor|
:View updated group members;
stop
@enduml

